   """


/ Comprehensive PDF reusing R Markdown
rocess markdown_report
   publishDir "${param{sample_id}", mode: "copy", overwrite: true, pattern: "*.pdf"

   input:
   tuple val(sample_id
         path(craminor
         val(sample_id
         path(dictiona
         path(logo),
         path(cnv_plot
         path(tumor_nu
         path(annotate
         path(cnv_chr9
